sequenceDiagram
    actor User as System operator
    participant API as Very long API participant name that should wrap cleanly
    participant Worker
    Note left of User: A note outside the first column
    User->>API: Start a very long operation with a request label that wraps into several lines
    API-)Worker: Asynchronous job
    Worker-->>API: Completed
    API<<-->>Worker: Synchronize
    API--xWorker: Cancel obsolete work
    Worker->>Worker: Persist retry state
    Note right of Worker: A note outside the last column
    Note over User,Worker: Shared context across the conversation
    API-->>User: Result
